# Root .env template — build-time settings for the extension. NEVER commit .env.
#
# Local dev (`npm run dev`): leave everything commented, defaults apply.
# Prod build (`npm run build` for the Web Store): uncomment + set VITE_SERVER_URL
# to your deployed server so buyers work without touching Settings.

# PROD: VITE_SERVER_URL=https://<your-prod-server>
